From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 12:58:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 47/49] Add a manual check of the Bilibili interfaces LiveHime
 uses
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

"B 站接口巡检…" on the Updates tab runs a read-only check through the same
client code the app uses: identity (nav and its WBI keys), buvid, live
categories, the LiveHime version info, QR login, room info, danmaku
servers and an actual danmaku connection, the official login, cover and
face verification pages, and when signed in the account's own room, face
verification state and blocked words. Nothing is sent, changed or started.
Each result shows its time and details; the report can be copied into an
issue and holds no credentials. Test hook: Probe.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
