+## Bilibili interface check
+
+The Updates tab's "B 站接口巡检…" runs a read-only check of the Bilibili
+interfaces LiveHime uses and lists each result; it is the manual tool for
+when Bilibili changes something. The `Probe` vendor request drives it
+(`{"room":"<room id>","action":"run"}`, then poll until `running` is false
+and read `report`). Signed out, the account checks are skipped; with a room
+id (or signed in, the account's room) the room and danmaku checks run too.
+
 ## Cover manager check
 
 `e2e-cover.mjs` drives Bilibili's cover manager in the real window: a real
